  "schema": 1,
  "entry": "Matched default223 stock-dispatcher and selected modal224 package routes. The qualified package prefix uses MENU to reach (67,56,0), then MENU opens the shooting menu. Four DOWN keys and OK open FILM SIMULATION; BACK returns without selecting a film. A second entry/exit and BACK hand back to the live view. After rollback, MENU/OK/BACK/BACK exercise unmodified-stock handback. All menu, state, event, resident and live-setting bytes are observed without host seeding. Generic state30 cancellation is not requested.",
